Uniswap/v4-hooks-public, commit 7da5210f2c81a700820a6b4f585264233d91f349, and interoperates with the permissioned
pool interfaces in Uniswap/v4-periphery commit 76c1891c481cebb4ff58f262473303f01a2d7393.

